### GET em um endpoint protegido (ex: listar usuários)
GET http://localhost:8080/usuarios/listagem 
Content-Type: application/json

### POST para cadastrar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/cadastrar/usuarios 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "numeroTelefone": "5123480239",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "nomeCompleto": "Fulano de Tal",
  "senha": "Userrrr12!"
}

### POST para fazer login e receber token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user@example.com", 
    "senha": "Userrrr12!"
}

###Utilizar token para acessar endpoint protegido
GET http://localhost:8080/cadastrar/listagem  
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJmdWxsc3RhY2stbG9naW4iLCJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiZXhwIjoxNzk0MjY0NDA0fQ.RJWfi9FIWsMDk7_EFKMOUJldbtK0CY0sPp23vAxRa-4

###Token alterado
GET http://localhost:8080/cadastrar/listagem  
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJmdWxsc3RhY2stbG9naW4iLCJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiZXhwIjoxNzk0MjY0MTUzfQ.anGqHDBbvrrtNAqiOrcvqwxXiu0GhbKwXRMHqWMYthkJuniorrrrr

###Token expirado (modifique .withExpiresAt(Instant.now().plus(1, ChronoUnit.MINUTES)))
GET http://localhost:8080/cadastrar/listagem  
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJmdWxsc3RhY2stbG9naW4iLCJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiZXhwIjoxNzk0MjU2NDIwfQ.yIEh0JgOSJmD_vsIF0jvRl14nvqzeu3Uvwl9vh5AGvU

### Cadastro equivalente ao curl (equivalente ao teste isolado do front)
POST http://localhost:8080/cadastrar/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "numeroTelefone": "11999999999",
  "email": "teste123@gmail.com",
  "nomeCompleto": "Teste Curl",
  "senha": "SenhaForte123!"
}